               its header tile must be recomputed on every groupHealth frame
               regardless of tile ownership. rdpmsBindSummaryTiles() below returns
               immediately unless EVERY asset type is checked -- exactly why the
               Faulty Station Gateway count froze under a single asset-type
               selection. When the owner IS 'summary', rdpmsBindSummaryTiles runs
               after this and remains authoritative. */
            if (typeof nfBindCombinedGatewayCount === 'function') {
                nfBindCombinedGatewayCount();
            }
