               produces without knowledge of the Asset Type filter, so it is
               only correct when every asset type is checked. Under a partial
               filter, nfBindCombinedIotCounts / nfBindCombinedNetworkCounts own
               these tiles and exclude the unselected types (e.g. IPS). Writing
               the station-wide number here on every groupHealth frame is what
